{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "1c471170dfcb7bd3efe7db2f0e02519ad2a64332cb94ceffec69876fbdb09d34", "ja": "真美ちゃん、かもん！なのです。\nお姫様が多い方が、パーティーは盛り上がるのです♪", "zh": "真美，来吧！♪\n公主越多，派对就越热闹♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "4cc6da3fba834ce48ae60317fa047a925f2fe21b9b59f2542bd1d2aeaa38819c", "ja": "おー、まつり姫ってば余裕シャキシャキだね？\nよかろう！　その挑戦、受けて立つよーっ！", "zh": "哦——，小祭姬还真是从容不迫啊？\n好吧！这挑战，我接下了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "8361634192e527560a68858cef00ecce4cc41b07713ecf7b5d07be558f85ef7a", "ja": "まあ！　では真美さんも、\n姫君役の選考会に出られるんですね？", "zh": "哎呀！那么真美小姐，\n也要参加公主一角的选拔会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1003_p", "source_sha256": "97ca9116b17761218855f32d45dea8f9fb4911d9d1ff8f24bf08ea0e235a3a51", "ja": "おーい、なんだか盛り上がってるな。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "喂——气氛好像很热烈嘛。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "7946fdc8fc06cd4518f455c9b2edb6cde5bbd016759f1d422a1952da422d4f43", "ja": "はいほー！　{$P$}さん。\n今、姫のオーディションの話をしていたのですよ♪", "zh": "嗨嗬——！{$P$}先生。\n刚才正在聊姬的试镜话题哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0c5fc36dcef779d9faf2bb8396ba2c854ba1ed4b23af5c452ef00be810048c06", "ja": "ああ、プリンセスミュージカルのお姫様役か。\n事務所としても、なんとか取りたいところだな。", "zh": "啊，是指《Princess Musical》的公主角色啊。\n就事务所而言，也希望能想办法拿下这个角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "735a92fcf8cd9dcc2f3bc5691fac6329b5ce383f50ea017fa9cd083e801ca775", "ja": "うぉっほん！　兄ちゃんがそこまで言うなら、\nしょうがないから真美も参加してあげる！", "zh": "咳咳！既然哥都说到这个份上了，\n真美没办法，就也勉为其难参加一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2d040a5aa7b90845aacc25f34b48b66ce973bc19566449171f7e6f48029172c7", "ja": "そうか、ありがとう！　まだ何も言ってないけど、\n挑戦は大歓迎だ。エントリーしておくよ。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢！虽然你还什么都没说，不过挑战可是非常欢迎的。我先帮你报名吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "842cadfbad01bee1cb74125eb7b2c3952f5328d5a039bb02d5bc97935a3c1135", "ja": "んっふっふ～。真美のへろもんキラキラなプリンセス、\n楽しみにしてていいよ～♪　キラぶちゅ♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～。真美闪闪发光的荷尔蒙公主，\n你就好好期待吧～♪　闪亮飞吻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "54a07c438e0d4baa07de24b8b2002e362bd6c1873ea444361bba64ddad04dc2d", "ja": "おや。高坂さん、見つけました……ですわ。\n{$P$}、お話があります……ですわ。", "zh": "哦呀，高坂小姐，找到您了……呢。\n{$P$}，我有话想跟您说……呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "0b7d407312783ee6025a997a433c05e11a1b41ceea2559db1708ab1700a59e4e", "ja": "探していましたのよ、{$P$}☆\n今ちょっとお時間よろしくって！？", "zh": "我一直在找你呢，{$P$}☆现在方便占用你一点时间吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1011_p", "source_sha256": "efc5654607b2cc2c1c644c6c756e62d4d37cd003e6d1a56349ceac7eff58ea57", "ja": "……よろしいけど、なんだその口調は？", "zh": "……是可以，不过你怎么这副语气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "6c77369cd994a663c22284d9ecfa2d9b8d47b87774508f362d169732cdecd60c", "ja": "……とってもプリンセスなオーラを感じるのです。\nもしや……ふたりもオーディションに参加するのです？", "zh": "……感受到了非常公主的气场呢。\n莫非……两位也要参加试镜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "7726180b2d65b1cc30b887bdd5e8b4e5e04a1c2a9e918ef17427b1878e797cee", "ja": "そうなのまつりん！　童話のお話は昔から知ってるし、\nやっぱりプリンセスになってみたいし～！　ですわ☆", "zh": "没错，茉莉！童话故事我从很久以前就知道了，而且果然还是想试试看当公主～！是呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "f1c9fb12b89986734db0e4190ce72ff11c54a3e087238a8d0c503ddd1f0f7bf5", "ja": "誰もが憧れたプリンセス役、見逃す手はありません。\n……ファイトですわ、瑞希。", "zh": "人人都憧憬的公主角色，可不能错过。……瑞希，加油哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0e3ef415bb450fc3ce1be12421dfe1e70dcfb9f1654c319b32a7bfc88ae81451", "ja": "わかった、海美と瑞希も参加だな。けどキャラ作りは、\nまだ早いんじゃないか？　変な癖がつくとよくないぞ？", "zh": "我知道了，海美和瑞希也参加对吧。不过现在就立人设，\n是不是还太早了？要是养成奇怪的习惯可就不好了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "2fc3e6dcb49ebe6f49ed36001d5ce058b3fd68dfe09c63db72a902be42da9c28", "ja": "なるほど……。では、やめます。\nところで、やはり徳川さんも参加されるのですか？", "zh": "原来如此……那我就不参加了。\n话说回来，德川小姐也会参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "f1a52afccd5536ce61bbe439faf71afe5c910c64f9caf7834f6dbd69d9606299", "ja": "もちろんなのです。\n今回のプリンセス役は、そう簡単に譲れないのですよ♪", "zh": "那是当然的。\n这次的公主角色，可没那么容易就让出来哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "41da0824b15f1e1ff0e62c425500cb19063d1b6be9bfefa54190b3c2a3ffde69", "ja": "だがしかし、真美も参加するかんね！\n新解釈のせくしー演技でプリンセス役はいただきだよ！", "zh": "不过，真美也要参加哦！\n用全新诠释的性感演技，公主角色就归我啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "e2c203d189af1172690cd033be663f199f4c61786abc333da24087dc34ea9544", "ja": "むむ。正面に徳川さん、搦め手に真美さんが立ちはだ\nかるとは……。強敵と書いて、ライバル。", "zh": "唔。正面有德川小姐，侧面又有真美小姐挡路\n……强敌，写作“强敌”，读作“对手”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "a58fbe810c04cc9252d4a0e394c42e844275b16b17f447c809430f344f30a948", "ja": "ふふっ、なんか盛り上がって来た～☆\nあ、えみりんも参加するよね？　みんなで行こっ！", "zh": "嘻嘻，感觉越来越热闹了～☆  \n啊，艾米莉也会参加吧？大家一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "971955cac9e7b3fa6e956afbeb15fee3b76874f56a62533d484dd2dc0b122a09", "ja": "はっ！　わ、私は……。\nあの、やっぱり、やめておこうかと……。", "zh": "哈！我、我……\n那个，我还是……不去了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "692c5efb03b7a2f69363f35af24b024e30fd14013a1499294bd69317a3c5dcef", "ja": "どしたの、なでしこ？\nお姫様に憧れてたって、さっき言ってたよね？", "zh": "怎么了，大和抚子？\n你刚才说过，自己一直憧憬着公主吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "de80c317f5d09ab9648fb2f0ebb2c87b3111a9361ca4060a1f8263ecd0f0d5f7", "ja": "そ、そうなのですが、あの……。\nみなさんが出られますし、私では力不足かな、って……", "zh": "是、是这样的，不过那个……  \n既然大家都能登场，我是不是还不够格呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "b7e624923a04032f4c36922a96c3beafcdc8d5ff0cba96c288a2e85900961f01", "ja": "……。エミリーちゃん、めっ！なのです。\nプリンセスは、欲張りなのですよ？", "zh": "……艾米莉，不可以哦！公主可是很贪心的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "b9db60bb695533bdcdd35e6cd620249fb46b0bf5ea8604ffbfa7d4ea40669cba", "ja": "まつりたちも欲張りなので、遠慮はいらないのです。\nみんなで一緒に、憧れに欲張りましょー！　……ね？", "zh": "茉莉她们也很贪心，所以不需要客气哦。\n大家一起对憧憬贪心起来吧——！……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "de62fe61a0dad33ab6208f6dadc4721ba5f0fc8e8bea4aa88e07f7fec087ae0c", "ja": "まつりさん……。\nそうですよね、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "小祭……。\n您说得对，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "2b24d320cf57e5ea0ee70ad7bbcd0c21f8c0dff975c61345c5ae56879cb366c1", "ja": "では私も、みなさんの胸を借りるつもりで……！\n姫君の選考会、参加しますっ。", "zh": "那么我也抱着向大家讨教的心情……！\n参加公主殿下的选拔会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "de0346d79488c8099c51ac9f1bed4ee80872b47a4c0fd180de56472784bdaa9f", "ja": "決まりなのです！　{$P$}さん、\nエミリーちゃんもよろしくお願いするのです♪", "zh": "就这么定了！{$P$}先生，也请多多关照艾米莉哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1030_p", "source_sha256": "238bec3f8680cfff1a76edf56e16c32be1dd6afd7e6bc558e1314b39d098231d", "ja": "……わかった。手続きはしておくから、オーディション\nの課題をよく読んで、準備しておいてくれ。", "zh": "……我知道了。手续我会去办好，你们要仔细看好试镜的课题，做好准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1031_p", "source_sha256": "9e66ef7a6d997d9c4cac71f8fd4b62c92954b793f6d1a48143c38477b014ffc7", "ja": "定期公演もあるから、忙しくなると思うけど、\n悔いのないようしっかり頑張ろう！", "zh": "因为还有定期演出，我觉得会变得很忙，\n不过为了不留遗憾，好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "c7ae33431a97865b505e1d2ff756a697e95e46c5cf65b6b0031f8b29b5747ba1", "ja": "はい（なのです）！", "zh": "好（就是这样）！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_138_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "c25be754787c231f4a654fabc33ffcbccea3f376f34aaab1d2e335ebd2ecea21", "ja": "はーいっ☆", "zh": "好～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
